{"base":{"webm":"/voice/elevator-stuck-base-c46ea0e6773c.webm","m4a":"/voice/elevator-stuck-base-c46ea0e6773c.m4a","lines":{"me|Hi, Boss!":[0,745],"boss|Going up? …What's that smell?":[895,2776],"boss|Well, at least we have sushi!":[3820,1921],"me|Haha, you have such good sense!":[5892,3077],"boss|Good sense? In a broken elevator?":[9118,3237],"me|Haha, that joke was very clever!":[12505,2923],"boss|Oh, thank you, judge…":[15578,1877],"me|Haha, that's a good one, Boss!":[17605,2259],"boss|Ha! Glad someone gets my humor!":[20014,2468],"me|Haha, I'll give you that one!":[22632,2031],"boss|Ha! See? Still got it!":[24813,2056]}},"followUp":{"webm":"/voice/elevator-stuck-followUp-db4ce24a1d5b.webm","m4a":"/voice/elevator-stuck-followUp-db4ce24a1d5b.m4a","lines":{"boss|I've used up all my jokes.":[0,1806],"me|…Wait, is the door opening?":[1956,1964],"boss|Phew… we finally made it out.":[4070,2586],"me|You worked really hard, Boss!":[6805,2076],"boss|Worked hard…? I just stood there.":[9031,2853],"me|Thank you for your hard work!":[12034,1397],"boss|Uh… we were stuck in an elevator?":[13581,3052],"me|Phew, that was something, Boss!":[16783,2348],"boss|Haha, tell me about it!":[19281,2130],"me|You suffered so much, Boss!":[21561,2593],"boss|Suffered?! It was twenty minutes!":[24304,2782]}}}